# Fully regenerable from data/raw/ via data_pipeline/build_dataset.py.
# It's ~19-20MB - committing a fresh full copy of it every single day
# (the daily GitHub Actions retrain job used to do exactly that) is the
# single biggest driver of repo bloat. The workflow still regenerates it
# locally on the runner each run (train_model.py needs it on disk), it's
# just not committed anymore.
